  "description": "Kim Anon, a superior demon with murderous intent, barges into Jae-Kyung's restaurant, demanding what is rightfully his. Powerless before such a prestigious demon, Jae-Kyung can only submit and oblige the stranger. First, the stranger takes his money, then his food, his shoes, and more and more with breathtaking entitlement. Even so, Jae-Kyung finds himself dreaming that this stranger will take also take him!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
